      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hot-dip aluminum exposure occurs at approximately 660 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitates improve the alloy's microstructural stability.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitates provide chemical inertness toward molten aluminum.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tungsten-based RHEA has a high melting point.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tungsten-based RHEA is resistant to corrosion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::chunk::000::abstract::e30693f104"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy's high melting point and corrosion resistance reduce its tendency to react with molten aluminum.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A nanoprecipitate-stabilized microstructure limits the formation of detrimental aluminum-containing intermetallic phases.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Resistance to chemical attack by molten aluminum minimizes erosion of the RHEA.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHEA-coated or RHEA-fabricated parts will have significantly less corrosion and erosion than conventional steel or nickel-based-alloy components.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
